      "v": 2,
      "zh": "看哪，仆人的眼睛怎样望主人的手，使女的眼睛怎样望主母的手，我们的眼睛也照样望耶和华―我们的　神，直到他怜悯我们。",
      "en": "Look, as the eyes of servants look to the hand of their master,as the eyes of a female servant look to the hand of her mistress,[NOTE:1] so our eyes will look to the Lord, our God, until he shows us favor.",
      "notes": [
